this is your alcohol.

00:00:04.404 --> 00:00:06.206 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We can do this.
We can absolutely do this.

00:00:06.206 --> 00:00:07.841 size:84% position:42%
-You guys made alcohol.

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:09.109 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We made it.
We drank it enough.

00:00:09.109 --> 00:00:10.844 align:start size:94% position:6%
We decided, you know what?
Let´s make our own.

00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:12.445 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Because it´s cheaper
if have your own.

00:00:12.445 --> 00:00:13.546 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Might as well.
-And this is whiskey?

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:14.781 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Just smarter.
You know what I´m saying?

00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:16.282 size:75% position:38%
-Yeah, just smarter.

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:18.118 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then what´s the name of
your line of whiskey?

00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:20.053 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Old Camp Whiskey.
-Old Camp Whiskey.

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:21.454
-And this is the peach pecan.

00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:23.423 size:84% position:42%
-Peach pecan and we got
the American Whiskey.

00:00:23.423 --> 00:00:25.692
-So this is peach pecan whiskey.
-Yes, sir.

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:27.560
-And did you feel like there was
a hole in the market

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.129 align:start size:94% position:6%
