[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.129 --> 00:00:31.398 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Kind of. Yeah. Yeah, we did
some market research.

00:00:31.398 --> 00:00:33.033 align:start size:94% position:6%
-When I bought it, I´ve never
seen that before so...

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:34.401 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We´re going to give you
a little taste of

00:00:34.401 --> 00:00:36.202 align:start size:94% position:6%
